title: Open Hour — SwiftPune
description: "SwiftPune Open Hour: an online session on one topic. Someone leads the conversation, then it's open Q&A and a chance to meet other community members."
ogImage: assets/Events/OpenHour/001/01.jpg
habits:
  - key: "// where"
    title: Online, on a video call.
    text: Join from wherever you are. The link goes up in the WhatsApp group before each session.
  - key: "// format"
    title: One topic, then questions.
    text: Someone from the community leads a conversation on a single topic, then the floor is open for Q&A.
  - key: "// who"
